  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xE9;sultats obtenus &#xE0; la fin du projet (d&#xE9;cembre 2020) : 1) le projet a vaccin&#xE9; 324 millions d&apos;enfants; 2) sauv&#xE9; 6,9 millions de vies; 3) achet&#xE9; 54 000 unit&#xE9;s de stockage de la cha&#xEE;ne du froid pour les pays; 4) 65 % des pays ont augment&#xE9; leurs investissements dans la vaccination de routine; 5) le projet a r&#xE9;duit le co&#xFB;t des vaccins pentavalent, pneumococcique et &#xE0; rotavirus de 24 %.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of the end of the project (December 2020) include: (1) the project vaccinated 324 million children; (2) saved 6.9 million lives; (3) purchased 54,000 units of cold chain storage for countries; (4) 65% of countries increased their investments in routine immunization; and (5) the project reduced the cost of pentavalent, pneumococcal and rotavirus vaccines by 24%.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) l&apos;acc&#xE9;l&#xE9;ration de l&apos;adoption et de la couverture &#xE9;quitables des vaccins; 2) efficacit&#xE9; et efficience accrues de la fourniture de vaccins en tant que partie int&#xE9;grante de syst&#xE8;mes de sant&#xE9; renforc&#xE9;s; 3) l&apos;am&#xE9;lioration de la durabilit&#xE9; des programmes nationaux de vaccination; 4) l&apos;am&#xE9;lioration des march&#xE9;s pour les vaccins et autres produits de vaccination.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results for this project include: (1) accelerated equitable uptake and coverage of vaccines (2) increased effectiveness and efficiency of immunization delivery as an integrated part of strengthened health systems; (3) improved sustainability of national immunization programs; and (4) improved markets for vaccines and other immunization products.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
